# Color layer

Enforced by `src/lib/__tests__/no-duplication.test.ts`.

- Formulas live in `src/lib/color/apca.ts`. `checkContrast` aliases `wcagRatio`. Never reimplement in a skill, MCP tool, or checker.
- Never `chroma.contrast` on hex. Only annotated `CONTINUOUS-PRECISION` sites may call it on a `chroma.Color`.
- Emit with `gamut.oklchToHex`, not `chroma.oklch(l,c,h).hex()`.
- One sRGB decode: `gamut.hexToLinearRgb`.
- Report WCAG and APCA. APCA is directional `(foreground, background)`.
- Categorical palettes: `cvd.validateCategorical()`. Do not eyeball.
- `*Reference.ts` — regenerate, never edit.
- Snapshots: read the ramp diff before `vitest -u`.
- Skill `scripts/contrast.mjs` must stay equal to `lib/color`.
- No jsdom. Vitest `environment: 'node'`.
